UID:7rkf0rsguk26vtepfehsqrttqk@google.com
CREATED:20250114T204649Z
DESCRIPTION:\nLast Group will go out at 4pm to ensure everyone if off the r
 ange by 6pm\nMust have 3 to 5 scoring participants per group \nMust Shoot 2
  Qualifiers and the Championship to qualify for an award. \nMust be 3 parti
 cipants in a division for 1st place award \nMust be 6 participants in a div
 ision for 1st and 2nd place awards \nMust be 9 or more participants in a di
 vision for 1st\, 2nd and 3rd place awards \nClasses will be combined if the
 re are not at least 3 male and 3 female in each division \n\n30 Targets (1 
 shot per target)\nIBO Scoring\n\nDivisions: \nOpen (max 50) \nHunter (max 4
 0) \nWomens Hunter (max 30) \nTraditional (Max 20) \n\nYouth (max 15) (12 y
 ears old and under) \nAdult $25 per scoring round \nYouth (12 and under) $1
 5 per scoring round \nFun Round $15
LAST-MODIFIED:20250114T205157Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Spring Buckle Series Championship
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
