 ay 1pm to 6pm</p><p>Must have 3 shooters in a group. If you do not have a g
 roup\,we will find you one to join</p><p>Division:</p><p>Open – Max 50</p><
 p>Hunter - Max 40 (no magnification. Stabilizer 12 inches andunder)</p><p>W
 omen’s Hunter – Max 30 (no magnification. Stabilizer 12inches and under)</p
 ><p>Bare Bow – Max 30 (No sights. No release aid. Glove\, tabsand finger sa
 vers allowed)</p><p>Novice – Max 20 (No limitations)</p><p>Traditional – Ma
 x 20 (no sights. No release aid. No stringwalking. Glove\, tab and finger s
 avers allowed)</p><p>Youth – Max 15 (no limitations. Must have 3 aided and 
 3unaided to separate)</p>
