DESCRIPTION:Theme : 60's Hippies\nJuly 16\,17\,18 & 19\n9am to 1pm each day
 \n\nRATE: $100 PER KID DUE AT REGISTRATION. YOU MAY CONTACT US TO CANCEL UP
  TO ONE WEEK PRIOR TO CAMP. IF YOU DO NOT CANCEL AND DO NOT SHOW UP TO CAMP
 \, YOU FORFEIT YOUR MONEY AND YOUR CAMPERS SPOT.\n\nAGE LIMIT: 7 YEARS AND 
 OLDER\n\nWHAT THEY WILL BE DOING: YOUR KID(S) WILL BE LEARNING STANCE\, ANC
 HOR POINT\, TOURNAMENT ETIQUETTE\, BOW ANATOMY\, ETC. DURING CAMP WE WILL H
 AVE DIFFERENT HAND / EYE COORDINATION GAMES THAT WILL BE PLAYED SUCH AS COR
 N HOLE\, LADDER GOLF AND (EVERYONE'S FAVORITE) DEFEND THE FORT. IF THEY HAV
 E THEIR OWN ARCHERY EQUIPMENT\, THEY ARE ALLOWED TO USE IT. FOR THOSE WHO D
 O NOT HAVE THEIR OWN EQUIPMENT\, WE WILL PROVIDE A TRADITIONAL BOW FOR USE 
 DURING CAMP.\n\nBRING A SACK LUNCH. WE WILL BREAK FOR LUNCH AROUND 11:00 AM
 .\n *SPOTS ARE LIMITED! 20 CAMPERS PER CAMP*\n\nIF A CHILD IS CAUSING AN UN
 SAFE ENVIRONMENT FOR THE OTHER CAMPERS AND/OR THEMSELVES\, THE GUARDIAN OF 
 SAID CAMPER WILL BE CONTACTED TO PICK UP THEIR CHILD. THE CHILD WILL NOT BE
  ALLOWED BACK AT CAMP AND A REFUND WILL NOT BE GIVEN.\n\nIF YOU HAVE ANY QU
 ESTIONS PLEASE CALL \n(817)360-4015 OR \nEMAIL US AT FORTGRARD@GMAIL.COM.\n
 3800 MINERAL WELLS HWY\nWEATHERFORD\, TX 76088
