UID:1b9kpfrvl6fjt1s92bkraeph4n@google.com
CREATED:20190227T190715Z
DESCRIPTION:Theme : 60's Hippies\n\nJuly 16\,17\,18 & 19\n9am to 1pm each d
 ay\n\nRATE: $100 PER KID DUE AT REGISTRATION. YOU MAY CONTACT US TO CANCEL 
 UP TO ONE WEEK PRIOR TO CAMP. IF YOU DO NOT CANCEL AND DO NOT SHOW UP TO CA
 MP\, YOU FORFEIT YOUR MONEY AND YOUR CAMPERS SPOT.\n\nAGE LIMIT: 7 YEARS AN
 D OLDER\n\nWHAT THEY WILL BE DOING: YOUR KID(S) WILL BE LEARNING STANCE\, A
 NCHOR POINT\, TOURNAMENT ETIQUETTE\, BOW ANATOMY\, ETC. DURING CAMP WE WILL
  HAVE DIFFERENT HAND / EYE COORDINATION GAMES THAT WILL BE PLAYED SUCH AS C
 ORN HOLE\, LADDER GOLF AND (EVERYONE'S FAVORITE) DEFEND THE FORT. IF THEY H
 AVE THEIR OWN ARCHERY EQUIPMENT\, THEY ARE ALLOWED TO USE IT. FOR THOSE WHO
  DO NOT HAVE THEIR OWN EQUIPMENT\, WE WILL PROVIDE A TRADITIONAL BOW FOR US
 E DURING CAMP.\n\nBRING A SACK LUNCH. WE WILL BREAK FOR LUNCH AROUND 11:00 
 AM.\n *SPOTS ARE LIMITED! 20 CAMPERS PER CAMP*\n\nIF A CHILD IS CAUSING AN 
 UNSAFE ENVIRONMENT FOR THE OTHER CAMPERS AND/OR THEMSELVES\, THE GUARDIAN O
 F SAID CAMPER WILL BE CONTACTED TO PICK UP THEIR CHILD. THE CHILD WILL NOT 
 BE ALLOWED BACK AT CAMP AND A REFUND WILL NOT BE GIVEN.\n\nIF YOU HAVE ANY 
 QUESTIONS PLEASE CALL \n(817)360-4015 OR \nEMAIL US AT FORTGRARD@GMAIL.COM.
 \n3800 MINERAL WELLS HWY\nWEATHERFORD\, TX 76088
LAST-MODIFIED:20190227T190811Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Kids Camp
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
