 arranged in our 3D course\nThere will be four 3D shoots and a Champion shoo
 t. Winners in each division will be competing for a Buckle at the final Cha
 mpionship shoot! Must shoot 2 qualifiers and the championship to be in the 
 running for the buckle. Your qualifier scores will be averaged together. Ev
 ery weekend you shoot you get 5 bonus points that will be added to your qua
 lifier average. Your qualifier and bonus point total will be added with you
  championship score to give you your final total.\nClasses\nMen & Women\n\n
 Divisions\nOpen \nHunter\nTraditional\nYouth (12 and under)
